{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34429","headline":"病中秋怀寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"病中秋怀寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病容愁思苦相兼，清镜无形未我嫌。\n贪广异蔬行径窄，故求偏药出钱添。\n同人散後休赊酒，双燕辞来始下帘。\n更有是非齐未得，重凭詹尹拂龟占。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}